+// On MinGW, std::filesystem::path::value_type is wchar_t, so passing a path to
+// a stream constructor opens the file through _wfopen -- the wide CRT. Windows
+// 95 exports that family as stubs: the binary loads and every open fails.
+//
+// Measured on the machine (tools/win95/witnesses/wide_stream_probe.cpp):
